  unitName: Hail Mech Reeze
  unitId: 20284
  unitNumber: 380
  description: A scientist from another world whose body is partly made up by a machine
    which releases cold air. Having heard rumors of her older brother's armor-clad
    enemy, she headed for their source, the Bariura Empire. On her way she would
    come to meet many people including a loud-mouthed martial artist and twin sword
    wielding warrior, but not once did any sign of happiness appear on her face.
    With almost tragic determination she silently worked on modifying herself, advancing
    her abilities to a state above that of a normal human, all the while accompanied
    by her cyborg weapon.
  summonDesc: You forgive what I've done?<br>I'll follow you as believing your<br>words
    has made me weak.
  fusionDesc: Oww...<br>No good, still not enough...<br>I need more power...
  evoDesc: I can't forgive myself.<br>That's why I will continue<br>even if it destroys
    me...
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
